    {
      "uid": "zhcn:814fb17e702a854c63cd72fa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以我发誓要鲁莽地挑战“MC参赛计划”，\n也就是接连参加比速度的“NHK英里赛”，\n以及比力量的“日本德比”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce2c042427cb5fd156fc2a2ab49b9c9e7c1ec8d00cc62dd651867574e05a10ef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
