    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d0ac7d197701b233f12a58b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我在伏特加的身上能感受到命运的存在。\n那是令人愉悦的──特别缘分。\n或许是因为她很率直吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0db1a994a529cb42c1596d37992dbd8a27b516f89c00ffcb2061226919ec69ad",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
