      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "既然受人憧憬，\n那我就该以最好的表现回应她。\n这就是前辈的责任吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "afd3c91f8089e59ec5523d4f43710a929af8d7c095a076162a2c1d45a467aef4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
