      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员破坏了那个“牢笼”。\n他独自出席记者会，坚定地表达想法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b96fe98c17673bdb53496f767b182ea98aba6c97f5a4138b0a7cae61270e3e66",
